└── IMPLEMENTATION_STATUS.md
```

## Developer setup (Windows)

```powershell
# Create and activate a virtual environment (Python 3.11+ recommended)
py -3.11 -m venv .venv
.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1

# Upgrade pip and install the package in editable mode
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -e .
pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
```

> If PowerShell blocks script activation, use the virtual environment's Python
> executable directly: `.\.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m pip install -e .` Do not
> weaken the machine-wide execution policy.

## Run the application (development)

```powershell
python -m maintiq
```

The native PySide6 desktop GUI is implemented in Phase 8. Earlier phases provide
the data, ML, and service layers without a GUI.

## Tests and quality checks

```powershell
pytest
ruff check .
ruff format --check .
```

## Packaging (Windows)

```powershell
.\scripts\build_windows.ps1
```

Produces `release/MaintiQ-Portable/MaintiQ.exe` and, when Inno Setup is
available, `release/MaintiQ-Setup.exe`.

